    "sub_name": "解析幾何與微積分I",
    "sub_ename": "ANALYTIC GEOMETRY AND CALCULUS I",
    "describe_ch": "Calculus is a course provides basic training in mathematics. It involves the differentiation and the integration. These are used to solve problems via geometry and algebra. Calculus has a lot of\r\napplications in many fields, such as science, engineering, economics and management. The materials in Analytic Geometry and Calculus I include the limits of functions, the derivatives, the integrals, the logarithmic  and exponential functions, and the inverse trigonometric functions\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "Calculus is a course provides basic training in mathematics. It involves the differentiation and the integration. These are used to solve problems via geometry and algebra. Calculus has a lot of\r\napplications in many fields, such as science, engineering, economics and management. The materials in Analytic Geometry and Calculus I include the limits of functions, the derivatives, the integrals, the logarithmic  and exponential functions, and the inverse trigonometric functions\r\n",
